      "word": "My Morning Routine",
      "cn": "我的早晨",
      "tag": "passage",
      "image": "images/ps-morning-routine.webp",
      "collage": true,
      "quiz": false,
      "lines": [
        {
          "t": "*First*, I get up.",
          "cn": "首先，我起床。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-first-i-get-up-987bb2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I get up every morning.",
          "cn": "我每天早上都起床。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-get-up-every-morning-7925cf.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "*Then*, I wash my face.",
          "cn": "然后，我洗脸。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-then-i-wash-my-face-4301a0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I wash my face with water. My face is clean.",
          "cn": "我用水洗脸。我的脸干干净净。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-wash-my-face-with-water-my-face-is-f28526.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "*Next*, I brush my teeth.",
          "cn": "接着，我刷牙。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-next-i-brush-my-teeth-cae3a6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I brush my teeth with a toothbrush. My teeth are white.",
          "cn": "我用牙刷刷牙。我的牙齿白白的。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-brush-my-teeth-with-a-toothbrush-m-9067fd.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "*Last*, I take a shower.",
          "cn": "最后，我洗澡。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-last-i-take-a-shower-85f196.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I take a shower every day. I am fresh.",
          "cn": "我每天洗澡。我清清爽爽。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-take-a-shower-every-day-i-am-fresh-ddd868.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "After my morning routine, I am *ready for school*!",
          "cn": "做完早晨的事，我准备好上学啦！",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-after-my-morning-routine-i-am-ready--d35054.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "added": "2026-09-04"
    },
    {
      "word": "I Like Rabbits",
      "cn": "我喜欢兔子",
      "tag": "passage",
      "image": "images/ps-rabbits.webp",
      "collage": true,
      "quiz": false,
      "lines": [
        {
          "t": "Hello, everyone! I am *Mumu*.",
          "cn": "大家好！我是木木。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-hello-everyone-i-am-mumu-445fd7.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I like *rabbits* because they are *cute*.",
          "cn": "我喜欢兔子，因为它们很可爱。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-like-rabbits-because-they-are-cute-537950.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "Rabbits are covered with *soft fur*. They have *long ears* and *short tails*.",
          "cn": "兔子身上有柔软的毛。它们有长耳朵和短尾巴。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-rabbits-are-covered-with-soft-fur-th-46732c.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "Rabbit begins with the sound /r/. /r/, /r/, rabbit!",
          "cn": "Rabbit 以 /r/ 音开头。/r/、/r/、rabbit！",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-rabbit-begins-with-the-sound-r-r-r-r-96d896.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "I don't like *dogs* because they are *scary*.",
          "cn": "我不喜欢狗，因为它们很吓人。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-i-don-t-like-dogs-because-they-are-s-4c7e00.mp3"
        },
        {
          "t": "What *animal* do you like?",
          "cn": "你喜欢什么动物？",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passages/a-what-animal-do-you-like-3f6fb0.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "added": "2026-09-04"
    },
